  (text "J1: WAVESHARE ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-3.5 J8 (2x16, 2.54 mm), Rev 2.0 numbering. 6 GPIO21, 8 GPIO38, 10 GPIO39, 12 GPIO40, 14 GPIO41, 16 GPIO42, 23 PWRON, 25/27 I2C SCL/SDA (GPIO7/8)"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 100f5805-5c3c-4e2f-833c-59885be00ee9)
  )
  (text "Hand-soldered pin header into the board's female J8. V1 boards number the rows oppositely (same positions): check orientation against the STEP at layout."
    (at 20.32 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid c8bf6a53-9cdb-4c33-a3be-8b6bc4670eb6)
  )
  (text "PWRON ONE-SHOT (DNP, D-056): holds AXP2101 PWRON low ~2-6 s after VBUS rises, in case the PMU's eFuse doesn't power on at VBUS insertion. Fit only if the bench needs it (interfaces §3)"
    (at 190.5 15.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid f583537e-e5d5-4fb4-bbfa-6f0c382a0776)
  )
  (text "FAN INTERFACE - FAN DOMAIN (GND_F). Fail-off, isolated (SR-08, SR-09, D-023, D-054; interfaces §2.1). >= 3 mm to node copper (pcb/SAFETY.md)"
    (at 30.48 115.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid c0e07fb9-f89e-49cd-8c41-89f7b6c24cf7)
  )
  (text "J-FAN = J2 + J7: J2.1 GND (BLK), J2.2 +10V (RED), J7.1 SPD (YEL), J7.2 TACH (WHT)"
    (at 30.48 175.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 3bb0cf57-d724-4be5-b3b4-6434df5044a9)
  )
  (text "J-OCC: 24 VAC lighting signal (FR-07, interfaces §2.2) - OCC field domain"
    (at 30.48 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid d692dc5c-5e05-4a80-a20b-be760b34b23c)
  )
  (text "J-DC: wired DC_RUNNING, 12-24 V AC/DC either polarity (IR-01, D-025) - DC field domain"
    (at 190.5 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 26745765-068e-432c-b382-d19870013c81)
  )
  (text "SEN65 (D-012) on +3V3. Shares the Waveshare I2C bus; its pull-ups are on that board, so ours are DNP pads (D-054)"
    (at 190.5 275.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 9318176e-10a1-47ab-a06a-59c3e5509ddf)
  )
  (text "INDICATOR: 6 x SK6812SIDE-A on the carrier's room-side edge (D-055, FR-15). GPIO21 -> 2N7002 inverter (RMT invert_out). 10k gate pull-up keeps DIN low (idle) through reset. Firmware caps LED current at 300 mA"
    (at 30.48 355.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 015230b5-072b-4d63-990f-3752457dd339)
  )

